# BD pipeline stall radar (T2.3): per-job override for agent_propose.sh
# (AGENT_JOB_OVERRIDES). Non-secret task wiring only — API keys stay in the canonical
# secrets.env, sourced first.
#
# EXAMPLE ONLY. The live file lives OUTSIDE git at
#   ~/.config/agent-workforce/bd_stall_radar.env  (mode 600, owned by dave)
# and is intentionally NOT committed — mirrors m1_signal_scan.env.example.
# Install: install -m 600 profiles/bd_stall_radar.env.example \
#   ~/.config/agent-workforce/bd_stall_radar.env
# That install is D1, not T2.3. The timer stays disabled until T2.4.
#
# Why this exists: the live override still execs bd_stall_radar_kernel.py directly.
# This file is the CC wiring: agent_propose.sh execs the m1-shaped runner, which
# launches headless Claude Code (Sonnet 5, box subscription) with a task that runs
# the kernel rather than reimplementing stall rules. AGENT_VERIFY_CMD is what stops
# a run that produced nothing from logging as a clean NOPROPOSAL.
AGENT_PROFILE=claude-sonnet
# AGENT_OWNER names the owning persona (design/agents/<owner>.toml) — the owner= field of the run
# log. Until T6.1 (2026-09-16) it also keyed a Hermes episodic store under ~/.hermes/profiles; that
# store is retired and nothing on this runtime reads or writes one. AGENT_PROFILE still names the
# RUNTIME and keys cost.log's profile= column (W1, 2026-09-02).
AGENT_OWNER=claudius
AGENT_TASK_SLUG=bd-stall-radar
AGENT_MCP_DEPS=none
# Optional: cap retries so a transient failure doesn't triple-run an expensive
# Claude Code pass (default is 3).
AGENT_MAX_ATTEMPTS=2
AGENT_RUNTIME_CMD='~/agent-workforce/bin/run_bd_stall_radar_cc.sh'
# Without this line agent_propose.sh skips its artifact check entirely, so a run that
# produced nothing logs "OK: run completed, agent produced no proposal" and exits 0.
# Safe because the kernel (and the task, if the kernel declined) print exactly
# `DECLINE: <short reason>`: proposal_or_decline.sh accepts a run that wrote this
# run's dated proposal OR whose log tail matches `^DECLINE:`, and nothing else.
# NOT SELF-INSTALLING: bin/deploy never writes ~/.config/agent-workforce/.
AGENT_VERIFY_CMD='~/agent-workforce/bin/proposal_or_decline.sh bd-stall-radar'
